<title>FINLAND: Finnish Feb wholesales volume rises 3.7 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Finnish Feb wholesales volume rises 3.7 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The volume of Finnish wholesales excluding VAT rose 3.7 percent year-on-year in February, Statistics Finland (SF) said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The volume of retail sales, also excluding VAT, rose  6.3 percent from the year-ago period, it said.</p>
</text>
